-- Rifts World Book 34: Northern Gun Two, five robot drones (printed 235-243): MAU-500 Coffin, Robot Floater Camera, DX-202 Cargo Walker, DX-204 GRUB, BRV-10 Vulture
-- 5 vehicle rows, with 41 locations and 4 weapon entries.
--
-- One-off data script, run once per environment. NOT a migration - it adds
-- rows, not schema.
--
--   node scripts/d1-apply.mjs --local apps/character-creator/db/~328-northern-gun-2-drones-a.sql
--
-- Written by scripts/vessel-sql.mjs from 1 worker file(s). Every value
-- is printable ASCII, every row cites its book, and a Main Body location
